senses.gloss:
शवस्, अस्, n. power, strength, vigour (Ved.);
water (= उदक, Naigh. 1. 12); a corpse; (आस्), m.
a proper N.

शवसान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. powerful, very mighty,
(Sāy. = बल-वत्, अति-बल); (अस्), m. a traveller;
a road; (अम्), n. a cemetery.

सवनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to the Savana (see
above); to be offered or poured out; to be distilled;
sacrificial.

सावर्ण्य, अम्, n. sameness or similarity of colour;
identity of caste or class; the Manv-antara presided
over by the eighth Manu (in this sense fr. सावर्णि);
(अस्), m., Ved. the eighth Manu (= सावर्णि).

सावष्टम्भ सावष्टम्भ (स-अव्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,
possessing self-dependence, full of self-confidence;
(अम्), ind. resolutely, courageously.
